[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よいしょ……っと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There we go..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふぅ。これで全部かな。いやぁ、それにしても\nすごい量だったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew. Is that everything? Man, that was a lot of stuff!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆さんにまで、手伝っていただいてしまって……\nありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you all so much for helping..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんなにたくさんあるんだもん。\n手伝うのは当たり前だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "With this much work, of course we'd help!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いやいや、本当にすごい量だよな。こんなに早く\n用意するなんて大変だっただろ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That really was a huge amount. Must've been tough getting it all ready so quickly!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁね〜。お賃金は弾んでもらわないとね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, of course. The pay better be worth it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははは。まったくだよな。団長なら倉庫に行ったぜ。\n宝石を確認するとかなんとか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hahaha, you got that right! The chief is at the warehouse, by the way. Something about checking the gems."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、用意がいいのね……ありがと。行ってみるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? How helpful... Thanks, I'll head over."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの、このブレスレット、最終仕上げが残って\nいると聞いたんですが、その宝石のことなんですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard these bracelets still needed some final touches. Those gems must be for that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。それを取り付けたら、運び屋に\n運送を手配すると聞いています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Once those are attached, I hear they'll arrange transport."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へぇ。その宝石って何か特別なものなの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh. Are these gems something special?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちも知らされてはいません。これを作れと\n指示されたのも、いきなりでしたから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We weren't told anything. The orders to make these came quite suddenly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、あのぅ。こんなことして大丈夫なんでしょうか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A-are you sure this is okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "平気よぉ。お賃金の請求ついでだし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's fine! We're just checking on our payment."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そーそー。レイニャだって気になるでしょ？\nどんな宝石を取り付けるつもりなのかって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right! Besides, Lenja, aren't you curious what kind of gems they're planning to use?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、まぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ。なぜ早く報告しなかったのですか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh* Why wasn't this reported sooner?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それが……私も記憶が曖昧でして",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... my memory is a bit hazy..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Director"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ただ思い出したからには、一刻も早く\n神官長様にお見せしなければと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But once I remembered, I knew I had to show you right away, Your Eminence."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Director"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうですか……ふむ。これが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... Hmm. So this is it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぜひとも、お手にとってご覧ください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please, take a look for yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Director"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……っ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "宝石の話をしているのよね。\nでも……どうしたのかしら？\u3000何かが変よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They're talking about the gems, but... something seems off. What's going on?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しーっ。気付かれちゃうよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shh! They'll hear us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あー、アー。僕は……私ハ、神官長。\n広めル……広めなさい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah... AH. I am... I AM the High Priest. Spread... SPREAD IT..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では私は再度、島に",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I shall return to the island."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Director"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は教会に",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I to the church."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おや？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、神官長様。私たち、ちょうど団長さんに\n報告に来たんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Your Eminence! We were just coming to report to the director."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うっ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだ、急にぶつかってきて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, watch where you're going!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Director"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんなさい、ブレスレットの素材を用意するのが\nとても重労働で、疲れちゃって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry, I'm just tired from preparing all those bracelet materials. It was such hard work."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんなに頑張ったんだから、\n報酬、弾んでくれるわよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After all that effort, I trust we'll be well compensated?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かった分かった。後で渡すから、楽しみにしておけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, yes. I'll get it to you later. Look forward to it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Director"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの二人、様子がおかしかったわよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those two were acting strange, weren't they?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。話していた内容も気になります",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. And what they were talking about is concerning."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ブレスレットの「宝石」、怪しいわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Those gems for the bracelets seem suspicious."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "調べてみたほうがよさそうです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We should take a look."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]